{
  "description": "D148 parser fixtures for entity annotation output (D147 recovery policy). Every name and sentence is invented; none comes from a benchmark dataset or from the P3-07 audit. One or more cases per malformed-output class measured in P3-07 (aggregate classes only), plus strict-valid and combined cases. expect: parsed (strict), repaired (D147 syntax repair, listed), unusable (error class syntax / data / eof).",
